::narrative: arc4_last_tide
@title: Arc 4 - The Last Tide
::scene: convergence
@title: Convergence Of Currents
!sfx: conch_call, rotor_sync
!music: rising_finale
 !action: Oceanic vortices knit a luminous lattice below.
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Every current we bent now returns to judge the sum."
::end: {{ convergence }}
::scene: ascension
@title: Ascension Of The Archipelago
!sfx: stone_shift, steam_exhale
!music: triumphant_coda
!vfx: sunrise_bloom
 !action: Islands heave upward shedding waterfalls of light.
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Mark the chronometers—history is re-forging itself." 
 [[ ENGINEER LYRA ]]
 "Stability arcs holding— ascension nominal!"
::end: {{ ascension }}
::scene: epilogue
@title: Epilogue
!sfx: gentle_wave
!music: soft_after
 !action: Quiet gears spin down into an emerald hush.
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Chart appended. Let the sea dream in brass again."
::end: {{ epilogue }}
::end: {{ arc4_last_tide }}
